{"title":"38","section":"3751","heading":"Termination of program","lead":"The Secretary may not make commitments for financial assistance under this subchapter after September 30, 1986.","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments1991—Pub. L. 102–83 renumbered section 1851 of this title as this section. 1989—Pub. L. 101–237 substituted “Secretary” for “Administrator”."}],"sourceCredit":"(Added Pub. L. 97–72, title III, § 302(a), Nov. 3, 1981, 95 Stat. 1059, § 1851; amended Pub. L. 101–237, title III, § 313(b)(1), Dec. 18, 1989, 103 Stat. 2077; renumbered § 3751, Pub. L. 102–83, § 5(a), Aug. 6, 1991, 105 Stat. 406.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 38—","heading":"VETERANS’ BENEFITS","identifier":"/us/usc/t38"},{"type":"part","num":"PART III—","heading":"READJUSTMENT AND RELATED BENEFITS","identifier":"/us/usc/t38/ptIII"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 37—","heading":"HOUSING AND SMALL BUSINESS LOANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t38/ptIII/ch37"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER IV—","heading":"SMALL BUSINESS LOANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t38/ptIII/ch37/schIV"}]}